  "limitations": [
    "Pseudo-speakers are inferred from train-only clustering rather than supplied ground-truth identities.",
    "Each outer rotation uses only three folds for model fitting after conservative prompt purging, leaving 595 to 638 fit records.",
    "The phone correction is a fixed shrinkage-median rule; its pseudo-count of 200 was predeclared and not tuned.",
    "This is a single scorer seed and a single fixed CTC seed, so it does not estimate training-seed variance.",
    "The calibration improves overall MAE and ECE largely by favoring the dominant label 2, while materially harming balanced MAE and labels 0 and 1.",
    "No validation manifest was read and no production artifact was changed."
  ]
